#* {{zh-x|漢 皇 重 色 思 傾國，御宇 多 年 求 不得。|A certain emperor of the [[w:Han dynasty|Han dynasty]]<ref group=note>A reference to the [[w:Emperor Xuanzong of Tang|Emperor Xuanzong of Tang]], whose relationship to [[w:Yang Guifei|Yang Guifei]] brought to mind the [[w:Emperor Wu of Han|Emperor Wu of Han]]'s relationship to his concubine, Consort Li. Bai Juyi would have considered it unpoetic to refer to his subject directly.</ref> placed a premium on his dalliances, and longed for a beauty who could lay low an empire. He '''ruled his empire''' for many years without finding such a beauty.|ref='''806:''' [[w:Bai Juyi|Bai Juyi]], ''[[wikisource:Translation:Song of Everlasting Regret|Song of Everlasting Regret]]''}}

